    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i get the inclusivity part, but some of my managers are worried that it's basically forcing a specific political view on everyone. they're saying it feels less like respect and more like they're being told how to think or speak. don't you think that's a valid concern for something like workplace morale?",
